WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.523
To upload John Deere's data dump file, go to Orders, and pick DTP or GMBH at the top.

00:00:06.976 --> 00:00:09.762
Click Actions, then Upload data dump file.

00:00:10.508 --> 00:00:15.064
Click Choose file, and pick the Excel file you downloaded from John Deere.

00:00:15.064 --> 00:00:16.911
Then click Upload and compare.

00:00:17.362 --> 00:00:22.552
When it is done, the app shows what changed since the last file, and emails the team.

00:00:28.839 --> 00:00:32.554
On the Dashboard, Upload data dump file opens the same panel.
